---
import { person } from "../data/site";
import { thumb } from "../lib/url";
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";

// The analogy the whole CV hangs on: the same discipline, two industries.
const rosetta = [
  { embedded: "Signed firmware", cloud: "Signed container images" },
  { embedded: "Bootloader refusing unverified code", cloud: "Admission webhook" },
  { embedded: "Watchdog timer", cloud: "Liveness probe" },
];
---

<section id="about" class="shell scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line py-16 md:py-24">
  <SectionHead index="03" title="About" />

  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="reveal lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-dim">
        <p>
          I got into this because I liked taking things apart to see why they broke.
          That instinct led me to automotive: bootloaders, AUTOSAR, diagnostics,
          secure boot — a world where you can't just redeploy on a Friday afternoon,
          because your code is now inside somebody's car doing 120 on the AP-7.
        </p>
        <p>
          Somewhere along the way I found platform engineering and realised the cloud
          people had reinvented everything I already knew, but with better tooling
          and much nicer error messages. So I do both now, and I'm leaning
          cloud-ward.
        </p>
        <p>
          What carries across is the habit: assume the thing will fail, decide in
          advance what it does then, and measure instead of guessing. It is why my
          operator publishes its own metrics, why the platform's README documents the
          half-failure case, and why the numbers on this page come from benchmarks I
          ran rather than from a feeling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line">
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line bg-surface-2 px-5 py-3"
        >
          <span class="label">Same idea, different industry</span>
        </div>
        {
          rosetta.map((row) => (
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] items-center gap-3 border-b border-line-soft px-5 py-4 last:border-b-0 md:gap-6">
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.75rem] leading-snug text-dim">
                {row.embedded}
              </span>
              <svg
                class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-accent"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
              </svg>
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.75rem] leading-snug text-ink">
                {row.cloud}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="reveal lg:col-span-5" style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface">
        <img
          src={thumb("avatar.jpg")}
          alt={person.name}
          width="512"
          height="512"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="aspect-square w-full object-cover"
        />
        <dl class="divide-y divide-[var(--c-line-soft)]">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5">
            <dt class="label">Based in</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm text-ink">{person.location}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5">
            <dt class="label">Degree</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm text-ink">Computer Engineering, UPC</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5">
            <dt class="label">Day job</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm text-ink">Automotive firmware</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5">
            <dt class="label">Languages</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm text-ink">Catalan · Spanish · English</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5">
            <dt class="label">Status</dt>
            <dd class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink">
              <span class="pulse-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              {person.availability}
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
